@startuml drv-state-session
title DRIVER-APP-001 - Session states (proposal)
!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
[*] --> LoggedOut
LoggedOut --> LoggedIn : login 200 and role == DRIVER\n(token saved)
LoggedOut --> LoggedOut : wrong credentials / not a driver\n(nothing saved)
LoggedIn --> LoggedOut : logout (token cleared)
LoggedIn --> Expired : any API call returns 401
Expired --> LoggedOut : token cleared, expiry message
LoggedIn --> LoggedIn : app restart with a stored token
@enduml
